  if [ ! -d "$dir" ]; then
    mkdir -p "$dir"
  fi

  if [ ! -f "$file" ]; then
    # Create template
    cat > "$file" << 'TEMPLATE'
# Agent Context State

**Session**: unknown
**Updated**: $(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%MZ)
**Role**: unknown

## Current Task
(no task set)

## Team Status
| Pane | Agent | Role | Status |
|------|-------|------|--------|

## Recovery
1. Read this file
2. Read current task file
3. Check agent panes with `tmux capture-pane`
4. Resume work
TEMPLATE
